WEBVTT

00:00:01.560 --> 00:00:06.490
No more math mistakes when knitting
swatches and establishing gauge.

00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:10.970
Find your gauge with the free
Knit It Now calculator.

00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:14.600
I like to record my swatch information
on a string tag and attach

00:00:14.666 --> 00:00:16.970
it right to my swatch.

00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:19.930
Start by choosing inches or centimeters.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.090
If you like, note your tension dial
number and the machine you used.

00:00:25.160 --> 00:00:28.210
Enter the number of stitches you measured.

00:00:28.280 --> 00:00:32.800
Enter in the measurement
in inches or centimeters.

00:00:34.040 --> 00:00:39.770
Then enter in the number of rows
you measured and that measurement.

00:00:39.840 --> 00:00:44.290
This tool will precisely
calculate your gauge.

00:00:44.360 --> 00:00:48.080
If you'd like, you can
also print the results.

00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:53.000
Learn more about swatching and gauge
in the Knit It Now classroom,

00:00:53.066 --> 00:00:56.090
Swatching is not optional.

00:00:56.160 --> 00:01:00.800
You can find it at knititnow.
Com/swatch.

00:01:00.920 --> 00:01:02.800
No more math mistakes.

